  "title": "The freezing process",
  "section": "Movie Facts # 6 of 10",
  "description": "In the fourth draft of the screenplay for The Empire Strikes Back, there is some extra dialogue concerning the wampas and a wild scene involving Artoo getting chased down a hallway by one of the fearsome predators, even as the Rebels blast it. Alarms buzz and Leia inquires if the downed creature has been examined yet. General Rieekan tells her they are working on it when the Rebels are suddenly alerted to a \"visitor\" — the Imperial probot. Since this interloper is revealed to be metallic, Leia rightly points out that \"it couldn't be one of those creatures\"— a direct reference to the wampas."
}
